4527670160", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825305_25220294534336826_1723459920886485174_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w_kzWkk8egYQ7kNvwF3Dvkw&_nc_oc=AdpKT_owXiHVLnt36xONQlSJ0ape-Z4SL3_lH6iemzkfO1-UumQc0jEGkXakplkGVaQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG-g8PC8T9N3OE5fH03cLVUUE8BB6d6bZmqr9dilC_0Tw&oe=6A806108"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR Match Gems \u2013 Puzzle Crush Game", "keywords": ["match3", "puzzlegames", "matchgames", "puzzle", "casualgames"], "long_description": "VR Match Gems \u2013 Puzzle Crush Game transforms the beloved match-3 puzzle experience into an immersive virtual reality adventure. Step into a vibrant 3D puzzle world where matching colorful gems feels more satisfying than ever before.\n\nUse intuitive VR controls to swap, match, and crush gems while creating powerful chain reactions and special boosters. Each successful match rewards you with smooth visual effects and engaging feedback, making every move feel impactful in VR.\n\nThe game is designed for both casual players and puzzle lovers, offering easy-to-learn mechanics with increasingly challenging boards that test your logic, focus, and strategy. Whether you want a relaxing puzzle session or a brain-teasing challenge, VR Match Gems delivers a balanced and enjoyable experience.\n\nPerfect for short play sessions or extended puzzle runs, this match-3 VR game is ideal for players looking for a relaxing, colorful, and mentally engaging experience on Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udd39 Features:\n\n\u2728 Immersive match-3 gameplay in VR\n\ud83d\udc8e Colorful gems and satisfying crush effects\n\ud83e\udde0 Brain-training puzzle challenges\n\ud83c\udfae Intuitive and comfortable VR controls\n\ud83d\ude0c Relaxing visuals with engaging gameplay flow\n\nMatch, crush, and conquer the puzzle board\u2014all in virtual reality.", "short_description": "VR Match Gems \u2013 Puzzle Crush Game brings classic match-3 puzzle gameplay into immersive virtual reality. Match colorful gems, trigger powerful combos, and clear boards in a relaxing yet challenging VR environment. Designed for casual play and brain-training fun, this puzzle game is easy to learn, satisfying to master, and perfect for quick sessions or long puzzle runs in VR."}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-games-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24612734015066664"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1322385899556862_6355697268398509568_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yhaJss14W_4Q7kNvwHkr3h0&_nc_oc=Adr3iaY8B4Ji495LSDkogi73rrP_-mY4zoO96LgHrxwVbVmIFFAv--b1BJVMjVnS-vk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQETWaVOCVRSf0iZiFECEgPfsZnFNr9mJyH5dI5LL460kA&oe=6A80434E"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "VR Match Gems \u2013 Puzzle Crush Game", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"},